00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:29.650
Next, we moved on to how
marketers and big tech CEOs

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:31.640
have sold us this false notion

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:33.920
of maximally optimizing health,

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:36.340
moving many from a fact
based health system

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.000
to a faith based system.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:40.000
Because we desperately
wanna believe in magic,

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:41.600
but I'm a skeptic of biohacking.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.870
So I ask in the space where I function,

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:45.810
which is primarily in social media.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:48.790
Anything that has new tech involved,

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:52.160
Silicon Valley money in
it, people get excited,

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:53.800
Elon Musk tweets about it,

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:56.840
and it becomes a huge story to
the general public that they

00:09:56.840 --> 00:10:00.110
think they found a shortcut
to treating some illness,

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:04.130
improving abilities, optimizing health.

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:06.680
And it could not be
further from the truth.

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:09.140
Because in medicine,
unless you're a clinician,

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:12.260
you may not realize that
changing one thing will change

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:14.490
three other things down the
line that you completely didn't

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:16.620
expect or completely negates

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.940
whatever it is that you tried
to do in the first place.

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:23.020
Have you seen biohacking in
the hospital with your patients

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:23.853
